SIGFM matching for libfprint: MR !530 (https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/libfprint/libfprint/-/merge_requests/530,
Yassine Oudjana, at bed05d29) merged onto 6f9479c3 with the conflicts resolved, plus:
- sigfm: accept OpenCV 5 (opencv5.pc) and make doctest optional
- secugen: use score_threshold (renamed by the MR)
- revert of the MR's "elan: switch to sigfm", so every existing driver keeps using NBIS
Drivers only use SIGFM when they opt in. Built from https://github.com/J0UH/goodix-5201-linux (libfprint branch).

